main:
ADDSP 1
PUSHIMM 0
PUSHIMM 2
LINK
JSR fact
POPFBR
ADDSP -1
JUMP end_main_32
end_main_32:
STOREOFF 0
ADDSP -0
STOP
fact:
ADDSP 1
PUSHOFF -1
PUSHIMM 0
EQUAL
JUMPC then_34
else_35:
PUSHOFF -1
PUSHIMM 0
PUSHOFF -1
PUSHIMM 1
SUB
LINK
JSR fact
POPFBR
ADDSP -1
TIMES
STOREOFF 2
JUMP next_36
then_34:
PUSHIMM 1
STOREOFF 2
next_36:
PUSHOFF 2
JUMP end_fact_33
end_fact_33:
STOREOFF -2
ADDSP -1
JUMPIND